      "side": 1,
      "message": "We currently distinguish between our own port being PD-capable, and the partner being PD capable. The comments for pd_unknown suggest that it\u0027s about the partner, but the fact that the unknown flag can be cleared based on our own policy makes it a little ambiguous. It might benefit from more or clearer comments.",
